# STRICT DHATRI THEME AND COLOR RULE (MOBILE)

You MUST strictly use the centralized Dhatri Theme derived from https://dhatri.store/.

## Single Source of Truth
- Mobile: `@/constants/theme` (`Colors`, `ThemePresets.dhatri`, `getComponentTheme(Colors)`)
- Matches Web: `dhatri_web_nextjs/constants/theme.ts`

## Prohibited
- NEVER hardcode arbitrary green or brand hex codes (e.g. `#39B021`, `#059669`, `#10B981`, `#2E8A1A`).
- ALWAYS import `Colors` from `@/constants/theme`.

## Enforced Palette
- Primary Brand Green: `Colors.primary` (`#4F7942`)
- Primary Dark: `Colors.primaryDark`
- Primary Light: `Colors.primaryLight`
- Primary Tints: `Colors.primary10`, `Colors.primary20`, `Colors.primary30`
- Surface Background: `Colors.background` (`#F4F7F9`)
- Card Surface: `Colors.surface` (`#FFFFFF`)
- Borders: `Colors.border` (`#E4E7E9`)
- Text: `Colors.text` (`#222222`), `Colors.textSecondary`, `Colors.textMuted`
